{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"Web nods to Rigatony and begins to write","created_at":"2020-08-05T06:52:54.922000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740462322975244290","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"'I grew up in London's sewers in a circle of druids dedicated to dealing with the waste and refuse in them. I quickly discovered an affinity for spiders, and eventually discovered that the nature of the spider was in my blood.'","created_at":"2020-08-05T06:55:13.047000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740462902313746464","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"They pause and continue to write: 'anything in specific you want to know?'","created_at":"2020-08-05T06:55:32.892000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740462985549447199","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"Riga shrugs \"It is just nice to hear of stories beyond our current predicament.\" He hands the note to Lilia to read, oh man dialogue isnt where this man excels","created_at":"2020-08-05T06:56:31.581000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740463231709085746","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
