{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"Lilia turns to Rigatony \"What about you Sir Rigatony? Any interesting stories?\"","created_at":"2020-08-05T06:59:56.901000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740464092883451925","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"He grins \"I could tell you about how I met Heaven's Call, or the year I was stranded in the Forest of Angry Goblins.\"","created_at":"2020-08-05T07:00:56.038000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740464340922007604","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"\"Or one of the times I was kicked out of a ball because of him\" he jerks a thumb backward at Heaven's Call","created_at":"2020-08-05T07:01:40.694000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740464528222978089","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"\"I would like to hear more about how to came across that blade.\" She looks over at Heavens Call","created_at":"2020-08-05T07:02:44.074000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740464794057965620","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"\"As you know, the Voxars are a Noble line. We deal mainly in different industries of trade, the most prominent right now is mining\"","created_at":"2020-08-05T07:03:33.961000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740465003299078214","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"\"My father caught wind of a mountain chocked full of rubies, so we set off to set up an excavation site\"","created_at":"2020-08-05T07:04:11.071000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740465158949961809","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"\"The locals warned us, multiple times, that an old tyrant's curse was laid upon the stone\"","created_at":"2020-08-05T07:04:47.550000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740465311953977355","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"\"Nobles are nobles, they work on money, not on superstition, so we dug.\"","created_at":"2020-08-05T07:05:09.978000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740465406023696464","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"\"I oversaw the operation, that is until we had a mine collapse\"","created_at":"2020-08-05T07:05:26.403000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740465474915008512","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"\"It was a terrifying scene, and I lead a party of miners to rescue those trapped below.\"","created_at":"2020-08-05T07:06:01.869000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740465623670194186","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"He pauses to drink some coffee","created_at":"2020-08-05T07:06:15.545000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740465681031757865","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"Lilia listens quietly occasionally sipping her coffee","created_at":"2020-08-05T07:08:16.743000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740466189373014107","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"\"What we found was far worse than a simple cave-in. The miners had blasted through to an ancient castle, encased in stone as if molded around the structure. The screams of the miners echoed through the hidden castle, but it wasn't from the collapse...\"","created_at":"2020-08-05T07:08:45.979000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740466311997423616","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"\"Undead by the droves crawled out of the halls, and forced our workers into the throneroom of the Castle.\"","created_at":"2020-08-05T07:09:26.122000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740466480369631315","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"\"With naught but a shovel, I bashed my way through to the group. The undead closed in fast, working almost as a cohesive unit. Then I saw him; Heaven's Call had been thrust through an ancient skeleton sitting on the throne\"","created_at":"2020-08-05T07:10:31.434000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-05T07:13:12.237000Z","id":"740466754307883038","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"\"The moment I put a hand on the blade, I felt it's power course through me, yearning to slay the undead\"","created_at":"2020-08-05T07:10:59.989000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740466874076364844","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"\"For how long I fought, I do not know. Minutes. Hours. It was a blur of decay and blood.\"","created_at":"2020-08-05T07:11:37.367000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740467030850797660","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"\"Ten men made it out alive.\"","created_at":"2020-08-05T07:11:54.452000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740467102510612500","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"\"The rest... The rest joined my blade and I\"","created_at":"2020-08-05T07:12:10.819000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740467171158917200","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"He doesn't seem sad, if anything retelling the story seems to have made him wake up a bit","created_at":"2020-08-05T07:12:51.989000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740467343838281728","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
