{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"Lilia smiles at Rigatony's story then nods to Web","created_at":"2020-08-05T07:15:01.671000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740467887764013097","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"\"I would love to hear about it Web!\" He is having a blast with this coffee, so awake. Gosh drugs are great!","created_at":"2020-08-05T07:15:03.276000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740467894496002069","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"Web smiles with their eyes and continues writing.\n'I was young in your years, but old in mine: 13. I was out on a normal scavenging mission with some of my critters. We happened upon a dead humanoid body, and began to prepare to move it. Suddenly several pairs of eyes peered out from the darkness. A pack of rats had come to scavenge from the body. They were large, must larger than expected. We were able to fend them off, but they took the body from us. We made chase, but my companion spiders had to stay behind to take a wounded to be healed. I was on my own. I followed them into their chamber where their king was sat. In that moment I felt power flow into me, the sudden awakening of my druidic abilities. I fell from above and my fingernails and teeth grew to sharp points, and I killed the rat king in one fell swoop.'\nWeb pauses again and writes: 'this next part is kind of gross.' They look to the others for approval.","created_at":"2020-08-05T07:18:27.851000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740468752545611777","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
