{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739078888956624906","content":"'Somehow I knew right then that in order to survive, I would have to show my dominance. I snarled ancient words as spittle came to my lips and suddenly I could understand the rats and they could understand me. I ripped out all of their hearts and ate them. It was gross, but it felt right. With the blood of their leader dripping down my chin, I dared them to challenge me. None did. And so I left, claiming my right as a hunter and true scavenger of the sewers.'","created_at":"2020-08-05T07:23:25.434000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740470000699179018","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
